{"type":"text","timestamp":1778975778329,"sessionID":"ses_1ccc91ca1ffeAz0tVsMxSuhbjd","part":{"id":"prt_e33380ff6001SngByYDtHQR26o","messageID":"msg_e33380694001BQpEbw8BOwr0xV","sessionID":"ses_1ccc91ca1ffeAz0tVsMxSuhbjd","type":"text","text":"I found the existing logical pattern: `RO_0002104` is used for plasma membrane expression and `CL_4030046` for lacking plasma membrane part. The current terms already model HLA-DRA/CD123/CD11c, so I’ll update the definitions, add the requested references without removing existing ones, and add `CL_4030046 some PR_000001350` for CD14-negative status only to `CL_0001057` and `CL_0001058`.","time":{"start":1778975772662,"end":1778975778327}}}
